comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T14:41:32.552Z",codex-sol,"Required checks confirmed: test (22), test (26), codeql. CodeQL stays unfiltered. Model quick depth keeps the original first 50/500 sequences with 50-case batch boundaries and generated operation totals. Integer property sweep selects a 25/201 prefix plus explicit zero/positive boundary regressions. Precision digit-boundary and capacity/privacy fixtures remain exhaustive. Full npm/Bun matrix moves to deep CI with scale 3 and 120-minute caps. Harness watchdogs round up to integer milliseconds; product contracts unchanged."
  "2026-11-15T14:42:14.737Z",codex-sol,"Historical successful main run 43656921036: full model 32.731 s; packed acceptance 33.504 s; hosted execution 2m01s (22), 4m50s (26). Job logs retrieved through the jobs endpoint after an empty gh run view log. Packed tests already prove Bun project install and bunx CLI/extension use, so retain graph-install smoke. Documentation path checks identity and corpus privacy plus the core privacy/input-guard cases after prerequisite compilation. Strict health installs clone-local drivers; plain tracker fixture isolates global PM settings. PR timeout 15 minutes; deep remains 120."
  "2026-11-15T14:43:48.214Z",codex-sol,"Local linked proof passes: typecheck 7.563 s, lint 4.006 s, five touched test files 77.219 s at quick depth and watchdog scale 3. New deterministic rational boundary checks retain zero and positive coverage beyond the quick prefix. Changelog check included this in-progress task, so regenerate its single changelog row. Unique-key YAML validation passes; actionlint unavailable. Quick coverage is running; full depth remains remote-only."
  "2026-11-15T14:46:08.909Z",codex-sol,"Final quick coverage PASSED through pm test in 121.830 s: 99/99 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips; 637/637 statements, 455/455 branches, 123/123 functions, 571/571 lines across unchanged eight emitted runtime files. Quick model measured 13.296 s; historical hosted full model 32.731 s is a different environment, not a controlled speedup estimate. Strict health passes after merge-driver setup in a disposable clone. Changelog, identity and YAML checks pass. PR #21 initial CI 43725992548 and CodeQL 43725992809 are queued; required-check wall time unavailable. No CI wait. Full depth and packed/revert acceptance on this head remain remote validation risks."
  "2026-11-16T07:23:52.681Z",codex-sol,"Final-template follow-up: audit current main; split deep Node 22/26 by npm/Bun with one gate per job; preserve active deep runs; route executable tracker and docs files through code CI; verify optional CodeQL paths and self-hosted setup. Measure latest successful PR jobs, run workflow contracts, typecheck and available lint. Release claim without closing; no release workflow or verifier edits."
  "2026-11-16T07:32:23.099Z",codex-sol,"Follow-up audit: required contexts verified through branch protection. CodeQL is required, so its paths remain unfiltered. Existing hosted-only npm cache/Bun setup and Bun version logging were audited and retained. Historical PR run 43820497226: test (22) execution 0m48s, wall 0m50s; test (26) execution 4m19s, wall 4m21s. All execution durations are below 15 minutes; long wall times are queueing. Items 1, 2 and 5 changed; item 3 retained because required; item 4 already compliant. No item 6 test-depth fix needed."
  "2026-11-16T07:32:24.293Z",codex-sol,"Local proof passed through the linked pm test command: typecheck, test compilation and focused workflow contracts; lint passed where defined, with the existing docstring gate used for pm-context. Strict YAML parsing passed; actionlint is unavailable. New classifier tests exercise executable tracker/docs suffixes, nested files, tracker extensions and data-only paths. Full depth is deferred to post-merge deep CI. No release workflows or release verifiers changed."
  "2026-11-16T07:41:32.054Z",codex-sol,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-unit/pull/23. Hosted source-head proof at 6be8f78d0b6f8672d0172aa2b2b364344042c416: codeql success, execution 0m52s, created-to-completed wall 2m52s; test (22) success, execution 1m12s, created-to-completed wall 1m58s; test (26) success, execution 2m50s, created-to-completed wall 7m23s. Runs: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-unit/actions/runs/43824696430 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-unit/actions/runs/43824696447. Typecheck, test compilation and all focused workflow contracts passed locally; lint passed where defined (pm-context uses its existing docstring gate). Strict YAML parsing passed; actionlint is unavailable. Tracker health passed with isolated global PM settings; pm-unit used the standard local merge-driver install first. The source and workflow changes are complete. This final receipt adds only tracker metadata; final-head CI times will be maintained in the PR body. Full-depth matrix and self-hosted execution remain post-merge evidence. Releasing the claim; leave this item in_progress and open for the orchestrator."
